Satish Ch. Koria, IIT Kanpur. Materials and Energy Balance in Metallurgical Processes, NPTEL video course 113104010; companion web course Materials and Heat Balance in Metallurgical Processes, 113104060. [Video sequence](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113104010) · [Complete web sequence](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113104060) · [Video syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113104010.pdf) · [Web syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113104060.pdf).

Complete the full web course and independently solve its exercises; use the whole video progression for further worked explanation. Follow quantities, thermochemistry, mineral preparation, roasting, smelting, ironmaking, conversion, fuels, and furnace accounts. Track the boundaries and basis of each calculation.

The official syllabi and public topic sequences were verified on 29 October 2026. Preserve the distinct web/video titles and actual source versions/component rights. External reference books and campus assessment access are separate. No transcripts, PDF chapters, or example datasets are supplied locally.

